sequenceDiagram
    title Figure 8 : Diagramme de séquences - Agenda (prise et annulation de RDV)
    autonumber
    actor P as Patient
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant Ag as Agenda
    participant Cache as Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant N as Notification

    P->>UI: Consulter créneaux
    UI->>Ag: GET /agenda/medecins/{id}/creneaux
    Ag->>Cache: GET creneaux:{medecinId,date}

    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>Ag: Créneaux en cache
    else Cache miss
        Ag->>DB: SELECT disponibilités
        DB-->>Ag: Créneaux libres
        Ag->>Cache: SET creneaux (TTL 5 min)
    end

    Ag-->>UI: 200 OK

    P->>UI: Réserver créneau
    UI->>Ag: POST /agenda/rdv
    Ag->>DB: INSERT rendez_vous
    Ag->>Cache: EVICT creneaux (invalidation)
    Ag->>N: Notifier médecin
    Ag-->>UI: 201 Created
    UI-->>P: Confirmation

    P->>UI: Annuler RDV
    UI->>Ag: PUT /agenda/rdv/{id}/annuler
    Ag->>DB: UPDATE statut=ANNULE
    Ag->>Cache: EVICT creneaux (invalidation)
    Ag->>N: Notifier médecin
    Ag-->>UI: 200 OK
